UID:sd4h-2026-deadline-short-paper@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART:20260503T115900Z
DTEND:20260503T125900Z
SUMMARY:SD4H 2026 (formerly TS4H) · Workshop paper submission deadline (4 
 pages\, non-archival)
DESCRIPTION:Structured Data for Health Workshop\nMeeting: 2026-07-11 to 202
 6-07-11\, Seoul\, South Korea\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-29\nFo
 rmat: Workshop / non-archival short paper\nOfficial source: https://struc
 tureddata4health.github.io/call_for_papers.html\nVenue Radar: https://gon
 -uri.github.io/venue-radar/#sd4h-2026\nNotes: ICML's official workshop pa
 ge and the SD4H site confirm Sat Jul 11\, 2026 in Hall D2\, COEX\, Seoul 
 (ICML lists 8:00-17:00 KST)\; accepted papers had to be presented in pers
 on and the workshop is non-archival (no proceedings). The site's Prior Ye
 ars menu links TS4H's NeurIPS 2025\, ICLR 2024 and NeurIPS 2022 pages and
  organizers overlap\, but no formal rename is stated\; it is tracked unde
 r the TS4H key by owner decision. 4-page papers were due May 2 AoE after 
 an extension (OpenReview's venue page and submission invitation instead r
