 xplicitly uses 23:59 AoE and requires a two-page paper\, video\, and inte
 ractive demonstration. The Feb 16 update is not a fresh submission route.
  XL reflects the official description of more than 2\,000 annual attendee
 s\; the ICORE rank and historical acceptance fields describe the main con
 ference\, not its demonstration track.
